BT 1 0 0 1 0 62 Tm /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 1.001606 Tw (Disaster recovery varies greatly depending on the needs of your organization. Your disaster recovery plan should) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.938864 Tw (involve analyzing your company\222s most valuable data. This audit should include an inventory of documents,) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.555606 Tw (databases, and systems that are deeply involved in the revenue-generating aspects of your business. As an) Tj T* 0 Tw .459064 Tw (infrastructure provider, we also have the responsibility to maintain the integrity of our facilities to the best standards) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.499631 Tw (and practices to safeguard your data. In addition to our responsibilities, you should take the additional steps) Tj T* 0 Tw (necessary to protect the integrity of your data against potential impacts on your private cloud.) Tj T* ET
