BT 1 0 0 1 0 62 Tm /F1 10 Tf 12 TL .409689 Tw (To have an effective disaster recovery plan, we stress the use of an off-site backup solution. Off-site backups are a) Tj T* 0 Tw .522594 Tw (critical component to preventing catastrophic loss of data and limiting the blast radius of an outage. Although some) Tj T* 0 Tw .14894 Tw (services in OpenMetal are highly available, high availability does not protect against unforeseen natural disasters. In) Tj T* 0 Tw .925783 Tw (the event of a hurricane, flood, or other unforeseen circumstance, it could be possible that you must recover data) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.779631 Tw (from a different geographical location. It is highly recommended that off-site backups are used for the most) Tj T* 0 Tw (mission-critical data.) Tj T* ET
