BT 1 0 0 1 0 50 Tm .224273 Tw 12 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Our Private Cloud Core deployments provide workload orchestration through the use of ) Tj 0 .4 .6 rg (Kolla Ansible) Tj 0 0 0 rg ( which deploys) Tj T* 0 Tw .486506 Tw (OpenStack services and infrastructure components in Docker containers. Should you want to make a change to an) Tj T* 0 Tw .742273 Tw (OpenStack service\222s configuration, add a new OpenStack service, or even repair your OpenStack cluster, you can) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.285783 Tw (do so using Kolla Ansible. In this guide, we explain how to prepare a Kolla Ansible environment, from which) Tj T* 0 Tw (configuration changes can be made.) Tj T* ET
